@everyone Offline mode is officially live.

Yeah, finally. This was the top requested feature on the board by a mile — 340 upvotes. You all made it extremely clear this was the one.

Huge thanks to everyone who requested it, voted, tested, and nudged us about it. It’s here now, so update to the latest version and give it a spin. If anything feels off, let us know in the usual spot.
